    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104049" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίρων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>, ὁ, = Lat.<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tiro, recruit</i>, <i><span class="en">
